        {
          "p": 19,
          "text": "D0.3 (Carrier Recursion). CARRIER(n) := the depth-n object in the pentagonal carrier recursion over regular convex polytopes, defined by CELL(CARRIER(n+1)) ≅ CARRIER(n). The recursion is defined only over regular convex polytopes satisfying this cell-identity condition."
