        {
          "p": 21,
          "text": "1. The Recursion"
        },
        {
          "p": 22,
          "text": "CARRIER(1) is the regular pentagon: 5 vertices, 5 edges, 1 face. CARRIER(2) is the regular dodecahedron: 20 vertices, 30 edges, 12 pentagonal faces. The 12 faces of the dodecahedron are 12 pentagons. CELL(CARRIER(2)) ≅ CARRIER(1)."
