        {
          "p": 46,
          "text": "At depth 1, duality is trivial (the pentagon is self-dual). At depths 2 and 3, duality exchanges the carrier topology with a geometrically distinct action topology. The duality at each depth exchanges k-faces with (n−k−1)-faces and preserves incidence structure."
